298
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:24,120
Please, guys, we have to talk.

299
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:27,120
Wait, wait. I'm getting a déjà vu.

300
00:19:27,330 --> 00:19:28,620
No, I'm not.

301
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:33,620
