302
00:19:37,050 --> 00:19:38,880
Okay, it's about Alan.

303
00:19:39,550 --> 00:19:41,840
There's something you should know.

304
00:19:43,340 --> 00:19:47,390
Oh, man, there's really no easy way to say this. Uh...

305
00:19:48,390 --> 00:19:50,810
I've decided to break up with Alan.

306
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:57,360
Is there somebody else?

307
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:01,740
No, no, no. It's just...

308
00:20:01,950 --> 00:20:04,950
...you know, things change. People change.

309
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:07,200
We didn't change.

310
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:11,700
So that's it? It's over?

311
00:20:13,330 --> 00:20:14,710
Just like that?

312
00:20:15,790 --> 00:20:17,540
You know, you let your guard down.

313
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:20,840
You know, you start to really care about someone, and I just...

314
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:26,930
